The Global Citizen movement reported that its supporters have been in 19 million "actions," where supporters have been demanded to carry out many different targets since 2011.
According to the Global Citizen group, these actions have contributed to world-wide leaders' announcement of commitments and statements that have reached a budget greater than $37 billion, and these commitments and statements are intended to affect more than 2.25 billion people's lives by 2030.
The Group noted 390 commitments and declarations as a result of the actions of supporters in early 2018, of which at least $10 billion had already been reimbursed or collected.
